\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluid Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, evade, and move through battle with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat flows naturally as movement and rhythm connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844290/extras/b46b53a1093c5f963bfd5284e2395e13.poster.avif?t=1773359977\" width=640 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844290/extras/b46b53a1093c5f963bfd5284e2395e13.webm?t=1773359977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844290/extras/b46b53a1093c5f963bfd5284e2395e13.mp4?t=1773359977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful enemies in tense encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful timing and observation are the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844290/extras/5ceb64ffa6ed4d2ccea7410fb2215938.poster.avif?t=1773359977\" width=640 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844290/extras/5ceb64ffa6ed4d2ccea7410fb2215938.webm?t=1773359977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844290/extras/5ceb64ffa6ed4d2ccea7410fb2215938.mp4?t=1773359977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Myth Inspired World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world inspired by ancient myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two divided worlds slowly begin to overlap as their stories unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Combat where rhythm and action move together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A distinctive visual world created from the game director\u2019s artistic vision, inspired by ancient myth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Side-scrolling action built around timing and rhythm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Every action synchronizes with the beat, turning battle into music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Soul is a side-scrolling action game set in a world inspired by ancient myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, jump, dodge, and parry as combat gradually falls into rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey onward, fragments of a forgotten story begin to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they travel through the same world, their stories slowly begin to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Twin Soul is shaped by harmony, rhythm, and the quiet cycle of souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its meaning is open to interpretation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player may discover their own connection to this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >